  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Blue Palmetto is a spacious, pet-friendly five-bedroom Grayton Beach retreat designed for easy, elevated coastal living. With a private pool, private elevator, and a complimentary 6-Passenger Electric Cart, the home welcomes up to fifteen guests with multiple living areas, flexible sleeping arrangements, and a central location just a short walk from the sand.<br><br>Highlights<br>- Complimentary 6-Passenger Electric Cart<br>- Parking for Up to 6 Vehicles<br>- Pet Friendly (Additional Fee Applies)<br>- Private Elevator<br>- 28' x 12' Private Pool With Cascading Waterfall (Complimentary Pool Heating Available October 1 to May 1)<br>- Pool Patio With Lounge Chairs, Fire Pit, and Shuffleboard<br>- Poolside Cabana With Outdoor Shower and Changing Area<br>- Gas Grill for Easy Poolside Cookouts<br>- Two Separate Living Spaces, Including a Lofted Bonus Den<br>- Expansive Screened Porch Ideal for Morning Coffee or Evening Cocktails<br>- Fully Equipped Kitchen With Commercial-Style Gas Range and Double Ovens<br>- 2-Minute Walk to the Sugar White Sand of Grayton Beach<br>- 4-Minute Electric Cart Ride to The Red Bar<br>- 8-Minute Electric Cart Ride to Seaside<br><br>Blue Palmetto offers a relaxed introduction to Grayton Beach living. Covered parking leads directly to the private outdoor retreat, where a 28' x 12' pool with a cascading waterfall becomes the center of sunny afternoons. Lounge chairs line the pool, while the fire pit and shuffleboard court add simple, enjoyable ways to spend evenings together. A poolside cabana with an outdoor shower and changing area keeps beach gear organized, and the private elevator makes arrival, luggage, and groceries effortless.<br><br>Inside, the main living level includes vaulted ceilings, warm wood accents, and a comfortable gathering space with a wall-mounted TV. The dining area centers around a large table for shared meals and card games, and the kitchen is fully equipped with upscale appliances, a commercial-style gas range, and double ovens. An expansive screened porch extends the living space and becomes a favorite spot throughout the day.<br><br>This floor includes three bedrooms. The Primary Bedroom has a king bed and twin bed, plus an ensuite bathroom with two walk-in showers, a soaking tub, and a double vanity with dressing area. A second bedroom offers a king bed with an ensuite bathroom. The bunk room includes a queen-over-queen bunk with easy access to the hall bathroom. A full laundry room completes this level.<br><br>The third floor includes a lofted bonus den that acts as a second living area, with a sofa, TV, and tabletop foosball. Two additional guest bedrooms share a Jack-and-Jill bathroom with a walk-in shower and double vanity. Each bedroom includes a king bed and twin bed, offering a variety of sleeping options for larger families or groups.<br><br>Blue Palmetto sits in the heart of historic Grayton Beach, just a short walk from the shoreline and a quick electric cart ride from The Red Bar, Zoo Gallery, Western Lake, and Grayton Beach State Park. Seaside and other nearby communities along 30A are only minutes away, giving guests access to shopping, dining, and family-friendly activities while still enjoying the laid-back character of Grayton Beach.<br><br>A stay at Blue Palmetto combines the charm of Grayton Beach with the comfort and thoughtful service of Sanders Beach Rentals.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Limited Time March Savings | Private Pool, Elevator, and 6-Passenger Electric Cart."
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
